text:
julie: opened a docs PR for a small "Cost rollforward playbook" card that ties together dashboards, tracekey grouping, alias mapping, and two micro-snippets (C# + PHP). PR: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/1527 :sparkles:

omar: nice. please link dashboards by ID (names drift). also include a tiny mapping table in the migration section so support can paste it into tickets.

nav: +1. ask: can the snippets show the X-Tracekey header + normalized `tracekey` metadata? also add one line about sampling: "span sampling < 1.0 will sparsify latency charts (recommended ~0.1 for staging)". and TTL note: "short TTLs -> higher miss rate -> increased token spend."

julie: added the two one-line bullets for sampling + TTL. pasted compact snippets below (kept them 5 lines each to fit the quick card). please double-check names and wording.

julie: ```cs
// C# micro-snippet: include tracekey for cost rollup by prefix
var md = new Dictionary<string,string>{{"tracekey","teamX/featureY"}};
await client.GenerateAsync(prompt, metadata: md);
// server: on hit -> Metrics.Increment("kv_cache_hits");
```

julie: ```php
// PHP micro-snippet: header -> tracekey + minimal example
$resp = $client->generate($prompt, ['metadata'=>['tracekey'=>'org/blue/campaign']]);
// on hit: metrics_increment('kv_cache_hits');
```

omar: nit: for the migration triage please add the explicit alias mapping example: `kv_cache_hits -> kv_cache_hit_total`. add a troubleshooting line: "If the dashboard shows zeros, confirm alias mapping and post-deploy redirect to DB-999-cost-rollforward."

julie: added mapping and switched dashboard link to ID: https://console.redwood.ai/dashboards/DB-999-cost-rollforward. moved full mapping table to a linked "Migration & Triage" blurb so the quick card stays short.

docs-bot: CI: docs build passed for PR #1527 but linkcheck flagged external console URL; please add an allowlist comment in the PR if the external link is intentional.

ops-bot: FYI platform change required: alias mapping update scheduled in next deploy window (02:30 UTC). a redirect to DB-999 will be created post-deploy.

julie: action items: 1) ops to apply alias mapping & create redirect 2) omar to validate runtime emits kv_cache_hits mapping in staging 3) nav to quick-proof the sampling + TTL wording 4) julie to squash and add the allowlist comment for CI. will ping when ready.

nav: quick proofed wording, LGTM with one tiny typo fix (s/rollforward/roll-forward).

julie: fixed typo and squashed. requesting final review from @omar when you have a minute. :pray:
